_niJp0N-JLKMtcFlGUXxNlqVrggKIwpqE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afx_VZkaiMYxAlCiMdIVy571hvk8BcFjA2jhRa_j5VcXog&oe=69C92D19"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "603762903542832", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982682_394634374507239_6439063808236322816_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rBC08cOa4IYQ7kNvwFMSpO4&_nc_oc=AdoboYJYt0Ny1bSi8gLR-wEJM3_DxOzG_nias2GYxZEfWaP2TZIWLmXFtTaN-zBzKoM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afzy7snH9yKVg0jQWlwyQ1tj0h6rRIS5UI3b2q0DDr4wEg&oe=69C92272"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "/tmp/u0V51Y", "id": "2491391347618703", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974588_2491391350952036_5915712212038582272_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6fVFBSmxN5AQ7kNvwHv-c82&_nc_oc=AdrhNntmG53gKiWjj_67Cn3sg0tgXWkDvs16uavccGQZD-CTdoJIjYxSWRKcXysqfYs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwtMKOGjS4g8ZrifeyWG93_4CYlSqhaPWBfA3_RX8xZhw&oe=69C92BCE"}, "display_name": "Kingspray Graffiti", "keywords": ["graffiti", "art", "spraypaint", "spray", "kingspray"], "long_description": "Creating amazing street art would be much more fun without the jail time! Kingspray is a battle-tested VR Graffiti Simulator, with realistic spray, colors, drips, metallics, and more!\n\nWorld-class artists have helped us create caps, realistic pressure and fading, metallics, wet/dry effects and real-world colors from Ironlak!\n\nWe have ten unique environments include a dusky city rooftop, an underpass next to the river, and an abandoned subway station! realistic paint surfaces like trucks, bricks, metals and various concretes!\n\nKingspray supports up to 4 players collaborating in Multiplayer! \n\nThis is just a fraction of the awesomeness you will find in Kingspray. Can't WAIT to see what you make!", "short_description": "Creating amazing street art would be much more f